              "text": "लहरी — lahrī — \"moody; whimsical\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आमचे मामा लहरी आहेत, कधी हसतात तर कधी रागावतात. āmce māmā lahrī āhet, kadhī hastāt tar kadhī rāgāvtāt. Our uncle is moody: sometimes he laughs, sometimes he gets angry."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From लहर, a wave or a whim, + -ई. Unchanging."
            }
          ]
        },
